{title: Only Trust Him}
{artist: John Stockton}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 84}

Verse 1
[F]Come, every soul by [Bb]sin op[F]pressed, there's mercy [C]with the Lord,
[F]and he will surely [Bb]give you [F]rest by [C]trusting [F]in his word.

Chorus
[F]Only trust him, [Bb]only [F]trust him, only trust him [C]now:
[F]he will save you, [Bb]he will [F]save you, he will [C]save you [F]now.
